We are looking for a passionate and driven individual who will be working alongside the Human Resources Team. In this position, you will be involved in a variety of HR responsibilities and the day to day activities that the department takes on. Through this internship, you will gain human resources experience, which includes drafting and posting job listings, participating in interviews and onboarding new employees, interacting with interns and employees, and working on special projects.
Responsibilities
